::  name       tally fold triple-sum gate
::  shape      triple-shape -> sum - int (@u32)
::  invariant  folds the three triple fields into one @u32 by wrapping add; zeros answer 0
::  example    1 2 3 -> 6 · 0 0 0 -> 0
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend a2 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-a2-tally-fold3-v0 · STOA335: list fold widens past pair (e246)
::
::  Ashvini a2 · the list fold past two fields — Mantra's Weave spoken at width three.
|=  xs=triple-shape
|+  sum  xs
